:: Meadow Sheep Sex Finish 

<<set $outside to 0>><<effects>>
<<if $enemyarousal gte $enemyarousalmax>>
	<<beastejaculation>>
	<<if $consensual is 1>>
		<<if $monster is 1>>
			You lie in <<bhis>> embrace still very relaxed and at peace by <<bhis>> warmth. <<bHe>> holds you close and you feel as if there's no place your rather be than here now in <<bhis>> arms.
			<br><br>
			You feel your eyes droop as you slowly fall back to sleep. You wake up shortly later alone. Although you know it had to end, you still feel a sense of longing to feel such a sensation again.
			<br><br>
		<<else>>
			You lay back, still absorbed in the woolley warmth of the <<beasttype>> resting atop you. <<bHe>> bleats happily and licks your face waking you slightly and opening your eyes.
			<br><br>
			You continue to lay together until <<bhe>> eventually gets off you and leaves to graze the meadow. 
			<br><br>
		<</if>>
	<<else>>
		<<if $monster is 1>>
			"See, wasn't as bad as you thought." <<bHe>> nuzzles you once more before standing. "Maybe I see you again." <<bHe>>says as he wanders away through the meadow.
		<<else>>
			The <<beasttype>> bleats happily. <<bHe>> licks your face before getting off you and wandering away.
		<</if>>
		<br><br>
	<</if>>
	<<clotheson>>
	<<endcombat>>
	<<link [[Next|Meadow]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<<elseif $enemyhealth lte 0>>
	<<if $monster is 1>>
		The <<beasttype>> falls back stunned "Was just trying to keep you warm." <<bHe>> yells as <<bhe>> runs away.
	<<else>>
		The <<beasttype>> falls back stunned before bleating at you and galloping away.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<tearful>> you gather yourself.
	<br><br>

	<<clotheson>>
	<<endcombat>>

	<<link [[Next|Meadow]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	<<if $monster is 1>>
	The <<beasttype>> lovingly strokes your face before <<bhe>> gets off of you. "Mmm, let's do that again soon." <<bHe>> lifts up your chin and licks along your jawline, ending with a nibble on your earlobe, then leaves with his tail swishing behind <<bhim>>.
	<br><br>

	<<else>>
	The <<beasttype>> clickets in satisfaction. <<bHe>> nuzzles your face before jumping off with <<bhis>> tail swishing, leaving you in the grass.
	<br><br>

	<</if>>
	<<clotheson>>
	<<endcombat>>
	<<link [[Next|Meadow]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>

